### 12 — Interactive 3D Tilt Mattress
```html
<div class="pro-tilt"
  onpointermove="this.style.setProperty('--rx', ((event.offsetY/this.offsetHeight)-.5)*-16+'deg'); this.style.setProperty('--ry', ((event.offsetX/this.offsetWidth)-.5)*16+'deg')"
  onpointerleave="this.style.setProperty('--rx','0deg'); this.style.setProperty('--ry','0deg')">
  <div class="surface"></div>
</div>
<style>
.pro-tilt {
  width: 230px; height: 100px;
  perspective: 900px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
}
.pro-tilt .surface {
  width: 210px; height: 48px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0f7fa, #22d3ee 50%, #0ea5e9);
  box-shadow: 0 22px 45px rgba(34,211,238,0.3);
  transform: rotateX(var(--rx, 0deg)) rotateY(var(--ry, 0deg));
  transition: transform 0.18s ease;
}
</style>
```

